**V2 Design Principles:**
- 🎨 **Rich color-coded status** (green/yellow/red) instead of ASCII symbols
- 📊 **Real-time progress plots** per agent (inspired by CAN Explorer)
- 🔲 **Compact cards** with expandable details (inspired by DearEIS)
- 🌗 **Light/dark theme toggle** (inspired by TRESMENT)
- 🔗 **Node-based view** for complex multi-agent dependencies (inspired by Heron)

